---
theme: {{ theme }}
title: {{ title }}
info: |
  Replace with a brief description of this presentation.
author: {{ author }}
transition: slide-left
# aspectRatio and canvasWidth default from config.toml [presentation].
aspectRatio: "{{ aspect_ratio }}"
canvasWidth: {{ canvas_width }}
# Colours, fonts, and the logo all come from the shared token sheet, imported
# by style.css. Do not add a `fonts:` block here: tokens.css already loads the
# brand webfonts, and restating a family in the headmatter hardcodes a brand
# value and double-loads the font.
# Icons are Lucide via @iconify-json/lucide. Use <lucide-name class="ok-icon" />.
---

# {{ title }}

<div class="ok-kicker">
  <lucide-presentation class="ok-icon" />
  <span>Subtitle or tagline goes here</span>
</div>

<div class="abs-bl m-6 text-sm opacity-50">
{{ author }}
</div>

---

## Agenda

<div class="ok-icon-row">
  <lucide-flag class="ok-icon" />
  <span>Topic 1</span>
</div>
<div class="ok-icon-row">
  <lucide-map class="ok-icon" />
  <span>Topic 2</span>
</div>
<div class="ok-icon-row">
  <lucide-circle-check class="ok-icon" />
  <span>Topic 3</span>
</div>

---
layout: center
---

# Thank You

<div class="ok-kicker">
  <lucide-message-circle class="ok-icon" />
  <span>Questions?</span>
</div>
